<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-schnakenberg-limit-cycle-turing-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Schnakenberg (1979) tri-molecular limit-cycle & Turing reaction-diffusion morphogenesis — Code-to-model traceability: 52/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Basic docstrings identify the equilibrium and Jacobian formulas (L26-39), but lack detailed equation-by-equation mappings to Schnakenberg (1979) Eqs. (15)-(24), Turing (1952) dispersion theory, and the 3 Lean 4 theorems in `morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_002_limit_cycle_turing.lean`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "1979-schnakenberg-limit-cycle-turing.py L26–L66: minimal docstrings without explicit Lean 4 theorem or equation cross-references <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8871db0/1979-schnakenberg-limit-cycle-turing.py#L26-L66>" ;
    pk:hasScore 5.2e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-schnakenberg-limit-cycle-turing-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Schnakenberg (1979) tri-molecular limit-cycle & Turing reaction-diffusion morphogenesis — Model fidelity to source: 52/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Implements Schnakenberg's (1979) cubic autocatalytic PDE du/dt = gamma*(a - u + u^2*v) + Lap(u), dv/dt = gamma*(b - u^2*v) + d*Lap(v) and homogeneous equilibrium (u_*, v_*) = (a+b, b/(a+b)^2) (L26-66). However, Schnakenberg's central Hopf bifurcation locus b - a = (a+b)^3, Poincare-Bendixson limit-cycle ODE oscillator, spatial dispersion relation sigma(k^2), critical diffusivity ratio d_c(a,b), and equal-diffusion negative control (d=1) are all absent in v1." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "1979-schnakenberg-limit-cycle-turing.py L26–L66: equilibrium, Jacobian, and single-regime 2D finite-difference solver without Hopf limit cycle or dispersion relation <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8871db0/1979-schnakenberg-limit-cycle-turing.py#L26-L66>" ;
    pk:hasScore 5.2e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-schnakenberg-limit-cycle-turing-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Schnakenberg (1979) tri-molecular limit-cycle & Turing reaction-diffusion morphogenesis — Morphometric validation: 34/100" ;
