    pk:hasVerdict "unfaithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-schnakenberg-limit-cycle-turing-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Schnakenberg (1979) tri-molecular limit-cycle & Turing reaction-diffusion morphogenesis — MorphoEval overall 40.1/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1 (v1) baseline evaluation of `1979-schnakenberg-limit-cycle-turing.py` (overall score 44.5/100). The v1 script implements the homogeneous equilibrium (u_*, v_*) = (a+b, b/(a+b)^2), 2x2 reaction Jacobian J_0, and a 5-point finite difference 2D solver at a single Turing point (a=0.10, b=0.90, d=18.0), but omits Schnakenberg's (1979) Hopf bifurcation curve b - a = (a+b)^3 and autonomous limit-cycle oscillator, omits the spatial dispersion relation sigma(k^2) and critical diffusivity ratio d_c(a,b), lacks an equal-diffusion negative control or diffusivity sweep, and performs zero biological specimen segmentation on `datasets/limit_cycle_turing/dictyostelium_specimen.jpg`. Overall 40.1/100 (faithfulness 33.6, reproducibility 55.5); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 8871db0; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 52, Morphological realism / specimen match 18, Parameter expressivity 35, Morphometric validation 34, Source and data traceability 48, Code-to-model traceability 52, Reproducibility package 64. Output judged: docs/media/limit_cycle_turing_comparison.png: rendered output of 1979-schnakenberg-limit-cycle-turing.py at 8871db0, image/png, 30690 B, 1170×520 px, artifact_sha256 eff14c72d4713c7707d9f6301a20de8ca565adc8bea363ab4b3e4e2f554abd6d (sha256 eff14c72d4713c7707d9f6301a20de8ca565adc8bea363ab4b3e4e2f554abd6d), spec_fingerprint e7a48d2f9b6eadc84256e32af6d90edcc5a9823751407e82e8ce1b2293da2e1e. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: e7a48d2f9b6eadc84256e32af6d90edcc5a9823751407e82e8ce1b2293da2e1e; artifact_sha256: eff14c72d4713c7707d9f6301a20de8ca565adc8bea363ab4b3e4e2f554abd6d; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/limit_cycle_turing/dictyostelium_specimen.jpg=e2d2b739211bda97..., datasets/limit_cycle_turing/limit_cycle_turing_reference.json=d46a92b16200c35b..., datasets/limit_cycle_turing/scout_manifest.json=e71deffb9f317a88...}." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Implement Schnakenberg's (1979) exact Hopf bifurcation curve b - a = (a+b)^3, Turing instability boundary d_c(a,b), spatial dispersion relation sigma(k^2), critical wavenumber k_c, and autonomous Poincare-Bendixson limit-cycle ODE integration with period T_LC and phase-plane limit cycle vs stable spiral comparison.",
        "remediation needed: Load and SHA-256-verify `datasets/limit_cycle_turing/{scout_manifest.json,limit_cycle_turing_reference.json,dictyostelium_specimen.jpg}` at runtime, and implement computer-vision segmentation of `dictyostelium_specimen.jpg` (sorocarp spore-head sori area/diameter parity, inter-sorus spacing, interior DoG aggregation centers & NND distribution, and 2D FFT agar wavelength).",
        "remediation needed: Simulate all 5 canonical regimes (turing_spots_standard, turing_labyrinth_high_d, turing_hopf_codim2, hopf_limit_cycle, equal_diffusion_control) plus a 7-point diffusivity-ratio sweep across d in {1, 4, 7, d_c, 12, 18, 25} and expose full CLI flags (--a, --b, --gamma, --d, --N, --steps, --dt, --seed).",
        "remediation needed: Upgrade `measure_morphoeval()` and `--self-test` with sub-bin parabolic 2D FFT wavenumber peak estimation vs analytical k_c, limit-cycle period verification, equal-diffusion ablation ratio, specimen segmentation metrics, and two-run bitwise determinism." ;
    pk:hasScore 4.01e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

